OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mainly dry and
OL,6,Fbright and feeling pleasant in any
OL,7,Fsunshine. Cloudier through the
OL,8,FTrossachs with showers possible.
OL,9,FBreezy at times around North Sea
OL,10,Fcoasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe cloud thickening with
OL,13,Fpatchy rain at times during this
OL,14,Fevening, skies then clearing overnight
OL,15,Fand turning chilly by dawn with a
OL,16,Ftouch of frost possible.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,19,Fwith sunny spells, although there will
OL,20,Fbe a scattering of showers. Light or
OL,21,Fmoderate northwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
